gnificance & Impact\n1. Who benefits from this work? Practitioners deploying compound compression? Researchers studying inference efficiency?\n2. Without actionable mitigation (pilot failed), is this purely diagnostic? Is diagnostic work publishable at EMNLP?\n3. Does this open new research directions or close them?\n\n### E. Specific Concerns About Claims Scope\n1. Strategy specificity decays from 15× to 2.1× — at what point does this stop being \"strategy-specific\" and start being \"strategy-irrelevant\"?\n2. LLaMA random also shows phase gradients — does this undermine the \"importance-based eviction amplifies\" framing? Maybe the phenomenon is just \"later phases are more fragile regardless of strategy.\"\n3. 7B-only: the paper says \"theoretically scale-independent\" for discrimination collapse — is this a legitimate argument or hand-waving?\n4. The crossover phenomenon (mentioned in review_context as \"genuinely novel\" by simulated R3) — is this actually discussed in the paper? I don't see explicit crossover analysis.\n\n---\n\n**Output Format**: Provide a structured review with:\n1. Summary (2-3 sentences)\n2. Strengths (bulleted)\n3. Weaknesses (bulleted, with severity: major/minor)\n4. Questions for authors\n5. Scores: Overall, Soundness, Excitement, Reproducibility, Confidence (use ARR 1-5 scale, half-points allowed)\n6. Positioning suggestions (how to sharpen the contribution)\n","uuid":"e7a37bd6-76cc-420c-a13d-f4c7b0eeb7e3","session_id":"8c935f96-e8ee-4264-8300-457f7616e2aa"}
