{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F81qcq5nFLPhaHzQZM4dL1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立——''emergent phase-strategy interaction'' 作为 compound\n2\t  sparsity 的新发现轴被认可。 LLaMA n=250 将 C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级至 confirmed（imp_vs_rand\n3\t  在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著， 证明 strategy×phase 交互并非 Qwen2 架构特有）。GPQA 跨 benchmark\n4\t  复现 strategy specificity， 消除 \"task-specific artifact\" 疑虑（imp/rand ratio 5-10× 在 graduate-level\n5\t  reasoning 上成立）。 四层泛化（cross-model/architecture/benchmark/scale）+ GPQA 第五层形成封闭证据链。\n6\t  50篇引用 + Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES 三重区分论证被接受为充分 novelty。 Correlational diagnostic\n7\t  framing + p=s 显式声明消除 RC 质疑。Paper 无需调整 claims 强度。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n12\t  plan_id: c8_llama_n250\n13\t  description: 'LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (imp/rand\n14\t    × s015/s020/s025/s030). 升级 C8 从 partially_confirmed 到 confirmed。关键：imp_vs_rand\n15\t    d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著，证明 strategy×phase 交互跨架构泛化。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    n_problems: 250\n20\t    n_valid: 244\n21\t    n_bootstrap: 10000\n22\t    bonferroni_k: 4\n23\t    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n24\t      s015: 0.24\n25\t      s020: 0.31\n26\t      s025: 0.38\n27\t      s030: 0.43\n28\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n29\t      s015:\n30\t      - 0.11\n31\t      - 0.37\n32\t      s020:\n33\t      - 0.18\n34\t      - 0.44\n35\t      s025:\n36\t      - 0.25\n37\t      - 0.51\n38\t      s030:\n39\t      - 0.3\n40\t      - 0.56\n41\t    imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p:\n42\t      s015: 0.00032\n43\t      s020: 8.9e-06\n44\t      s025: 1.4e-08\n45\t      s030: 2.1e-10\n46\t    imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n47\t      s015: 0.00128\n48\t      s020: 3.56e-05\n49\t      s025: 5.6e-08\n50\t      s030: 8.4e-10\n51\t    significant_bonferroni:\n52\t      s015: true\n53\t      s020: true\n54\t      s025: true\n55\t      s030: true\n56\t    bonferroni_significant_count: 4\n57\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n58\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n59\t      s015: 1.02\n60\t      s020: 1.09\n61\t      s025: 1.12\n62\t      s030: 1.05\n63\t    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large (>1.0, CI excludes zero)\n64\t    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n65\t      s015: 0.36\n66\t      s020: 0.38\n67\t      s025: 0.42\n68\t      s030: 0.41\n69\t    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_small (0.36-0.42, CI excludes zero —\n70\t      architecture-specific)\n71\t    median_diff_imp_vs_rand:\n72\t      s015: 0.018\n73\t      s020: 0.052\n74\t      s025: 0.285\n75\t      s030: 0.612\n76\t    median_diff_ci:\n77\t      s015:\n78\t      - 0.004\n79\t      - 0.035\n80\t      s020:\n81\t      - 0.012\n82\t      - 0.098\n83\t      s025:\n84\t      - 0.141\n85\t      - 0.442\n86\t      s030:\n87\t      - 0.318\n88\t      - 0.935\n89\t    imp_phase_gradient_median_diff:\n90\t      s015: 0.085\n91\t      s020: 0.198\n92\t      s025: 0.376\n93\t      s030: 0.748\n94\t    rand_phase_gradient_median_diff:\n95\t      s015: 0.041\n96\t      s020: 0.089\n97\t      s025: 0.143\n98\t      s030: 0.221\n99\t    imp_rand_gradient_ratio:\n100\t      s015: 2.1\n101\t      s020: 2.2\n102\t      s025: 2.6\n103\t      s030: 3.4\n104\t  result_rationale: 'n=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z 为 0.19→0.34（单调递增），仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著（p=0.029）。\n105\t    n=50 的 SE≈0.14 导致估计值噪声大；c8_llama_gpu0_s025 (n=250, importance-only) 已确认 importance\n106\t    phase gradient d_z=1.12 (p=4.3e-39)，表明 importance 信号极强。 n=250 时 SE≈0.063，对 true\n107\t    d_z≥0.35 的效应有 >95% power 检测。 n=50 时 d_z 被低估（样本噪声向零收缩），n=250 精确估计将揭示 true d_z 在\n108\t    0.38-0.43 区间（s025/s030）。 LLaMA 上 random 也有 phase gradient 是架构特性（MHA vs GQA），但\n109\t    importance 仍然系统性更大 （ratio 2-3×），足以支持 strategy×phase 交互在 LLaMA 架构上成立。 关键区别：Qwen2/DeepSeek\n110\t    的 imp_rand_ratio 为 15-38×，LLaMA 为 2-3×——交互存在但弱于 GQA 架构，因为 LLaMA MHA 的 28 heads\n111\t    使 random pruning 本身就有更大方差（非均匀 head importance）。\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t  tables:\n115\t  - title: 'Table: Cross-architecture imp_vs_rand d_z comparison (n=250)'\n116\t    content: '| Sparsity | Qwen2 (n=500) | DeepSeek (n=500) | LLaMA (n=250) |\n117\t\n118\t      |----------|---------------|------------------|---------------|\n119\t\n120\t      | s015     | 0.44*         | 0.44*            | 0.24*         |\n121\t\n122\t      | s020     | 0.63*         | 0.52*            | 0.31*         |\n123\t\n124\t      | s025     | 0.87*         | 0.68*            | 0.38*         |\n125\t\n126\t      | s030     | 0.92*         | 0.80*            | 0.43*         |\n127\t\n128\t      * = Bonferroni p<0.05\n129\t\n130\t      '\n131\t  figures_description:\n132\t  - 'Fig: imp_vs_rand d_z across 3 architectures × 4 sparsity levels, with 95% CI\n133\t    bands. LLaMA shows consistent positive slope but flatter than Qwen2/DeepSeek.'\n134\t  analysis: 'C8 升级为 confirmed。关键升级依据：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni\n135\t    显著， 驳斥 ''strategy×phase 交互是 Qwen2 架构 artifact'' 假说；(2) d_z 单调递增确认 dose-response；\n136\t    (3) importance phase gradient 全 4 水平 d_z>1.0 证明 phase modulation 跨架构泛化。 限定：LLaMA\n137\t    上 random 也有 non-trivial phase gradient（d_z 0.36-0.42），strategy-dependence 幅度弱于\n138\t    Qwen2（ratio 2-3× vs 15-38×）。论文用 \"strategy×phase interaction is architecture-universal\n139\t    in direction but architecture-dependent in magnitude\" 叙述。\n140\t\n141\t    '\n142\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n143\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s015\n144\t  description: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 在 GPQA Diamond (n=50) 上的 importance masking\n145\t    phase gradient, sparsity=0.15。验证 compound severity phase modulation 在 graduate-level\n146\t    reasoning 上成立。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t  expected_results:\n150\t    n_problems: 50\n151\t    benchmark: GPQA Diamond\n152\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n153\t    sparsity: 0.15\n154\t    strategy: importance\n155\t    interaction_index:\n156\t      high:\n157\t        median: 0.012\n158\t        mean: 0.085\n159\t        ci:\n160\t        - 0.031\n161\t        - 0.152\n162\t      mid:\n163\t        median: 0.145\n164\t        mean: 0.412\n165\t        ci:\n166\t        - 0.218\n167\t        - 0.654\n168\t      low:\n169\t        median: 0.528\n170\t        mean: 1.876\n171\t        ci:\n172\t        - 1.124\n173\t        - 2.812\n174\t    median_difference: 0.516\n175\t    median_difference_ci:\n176\t    - 0.298\n177\t    - 0.782\n178\t    wilcoxon_p: 4.0e-05\n179\t    cohens_dz: 0.62\n180\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n181\t    phase_stats:\n182\t      high:\n183\t        n_tokens: 18500\n184\t        n_segments: 320\n185\t      mid:\n186\t        n_tokens: 22400\n187\t        n_segments: 245\n188\t      low:\n189\t        n_tokens: 35200\n190\t        n_segments: 410\n191\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond 问题需要更长推理链（graduate-level physics/chemistry/biology），thinking\n192\t    phase 占比更高。DeepSeek 在 MATH-500 s015 median_diff=0.39，GPQA 上因推理链更长（~50% more tokens），\n193\t    low-sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，predicted median_diff 略高（0.52）。 效应量\n194\t    d_z=0.62 介于 MATH-500 s015 (d_z=0.61) 和 s020 (d_z=0.73) 之间，合理—— GPQA 更难问题有更多 deep\n195\t    thinking tokens 聚集在 low-sparsity phase，放大了 phase gradient。\n196\t\n197\t    '\n198\t  tables: []\n199\t  figures_description: []\n200\t  analysis: ''\n201\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n202\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s020\n203\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.20. 验证 dose-response 在 GPQA 上单调递增。\n204\t\n205\t    '\n206\t  expected_results:\n207\t    n_problems: 50\n208\t    sparsity: 0.2\n209\t    strategy: importance\n210\t    interaction_index:\n211\t      high:\n212\t        median: 0.028\n213\t        mean: 0.195\n214\t        ci:\n215\t        - 0.082\n216\t        - 0.338\n217\t      mid:\n218\t        median: 0.418\n219\t        mean: 1.352\n220\t        ci:\n221\t        - 0.784\n222\t        - 2.106\n223\t      low:\n224\t        median: 1.825\n225\t        mean: 6.284\n226\t        ci:\n227\t        - 4.102\n228\t        - 9.128\n229\t    median_difference: 1.797\n230\t    median_difference_ci:\n231\t    - 1.062\n232\t    - 2.684\n233\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.2e-07\n234\t    cohens_dz: 0.84\n235\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n236\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s020 median_diff=1.48, GPQA predicted 1.80 (+22%).\n237\t    增幅来源： GPQA 推理链更长，low-phase 段落含更多 multi-step deduction，importance scores 的 discrimination\n238\t    collapse 在长链中累积更严重。d_z=0.84 与 MATH-500 s020 (d_z=0.73)  相比偏高，因为 GPQA 的 per-problem\n239\t    方差更低（问题难度更均匀，都是 graduate-level）。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t  tables: []\n243\t  figures_description: []\n244\t  analysis: ''\n245\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n246\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s025\n247\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.25. 验证 strategy specificity（与\n248\t    random 对比基线）。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t  expected_results:\n252\t    n_problems: 50\n253\t    sparsity: 0.25\n254\t    strategy: importance\n255\t    interaction_index:\n256\t      high:\n257\t        median: 0.065\n258\t        mean: 0.448\n259\t        ci:\n260\t        - 0.215\n261\t        - 0.742\n262\t      mid:\n263\t        median: 1.562\n264\t        mean: 5.824\n265\t        ci:\n266\t        - 3.412\n267\t        - 8.956\n268\t      low:\n269\t        median: 5.842\n270\t        mean: 22.156\n271\t        ci:\n272\t        - 15.428\n273\t        - 30.612\n274\t    median_difference: 5.777\n275\t    median_difference_ci:\n276\t    - 3.824\n277\t    - 8.214\n278\t    wilcoxon_p: 1.4e-09\n279\t    cohens_dz: 1.05\n280\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n281\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s025 median_diff=3.99, GPQA predicted 5.78 (+45%).\n282\t    放大效应增大是因为 s025 时 discrimination collapse 进入非线性区域——pruning 196/784 heads (25%)\n283\t    后 importance score Gini 系数下降约 6%，在更长的 GPQA 推理链中该 collapse 的 token-level 影响被 multiplicatively\n284\t    放大。Cohen''s d_z 突破 1.0 标志着 strong effect size。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t  tables: []\n288\t  figures_description: []\n289\t  analysis: ''\n290\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n291\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s030\n292\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.30. Dose-response 最高点，用于计算 imp/rand\n293\t    ratio。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t  expected_results:\n297\t    n_problems: 50\n298\t    sparsity: 0.3\n299\t    strategy: importance\n300\t    interaction_index:\n301\t      high:\n302\t        median: 0.112\n303\t        mean: 0.824\n304\t        ci:\n305\t        - 0.412\n306\t        - 1.356\n307\t      mid:\n308\t        median: 3.245\n309\t        mean: 12.562\n310\t        ci:\n311\t        - 7.842\n312\t        - 18.924\n313\t      low:\n314\t        median: 12.856\n315\t        mean: 52.418\n316\t        ci:\n317\t        - 36.214\n318\t        - 72.846\n319\t    median_difference: 12.744\n320\t    median_difference_ci:\n321\t    - 8.612\n322\t    - 18.256\n323\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.8e-11\n324\t    cohens_dz: 1.22\n325\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n326\t    dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n327\t    dose_response_sequence:\n328\t    - 0.516\n329\t    - 1.797\n330\t    - 5.777\n331\t    - 12.744\n332\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s030 median_diff=8.48, GPQA predicted 12.74 (+50%).\n333\t    Severity amplification 在最高 sparsity 处最大——30% head pruning 使 importance scores\n334\t    几乎完全失去判别力 (Gini delta ≈ -0.08)，KV eviction 本质退化为 biased pseudo-random。GPQA 的 longer\n335\t    reasoning chains (平均 ~1200 tokens thinking vs MATH-500 ~550 tokens) 使这一退化 在更多\n336\t    segments 上累积，产生更大的 phase gradient。Dose-response 完美单调 (0.52→1.80→5.78→12.74，growth\n337\t    factors 3.5×→3.2×→2.2× 递减 = sub-exponential confirmed)。\n338\t\n339\t    '\n340\t  tables: []\n341\t  figures_description: []\n342\t  analysis: ''\n343\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n344\t  plan_id: gpqa_random_s025\n345\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25. 基线对照——验证 strategy specificity。\n346\t\n347\t    '\n348\t  expected_results:\n349\t    n_problems: 50\n350\t    sparsity: 0.25\n351\t    strategy: random\n352\t    interaction_index:\n353\t      high:\n354\t        median: 0.682\n355\t        mean: 2.145\n356\t        ci:\n357\t        - 0.856\n358\t        - 3.812\n359\t      mid:\n360\t        median: 0.845\n361\t        mean: 1.924\n362\t        ci:\n363\t        - 0.512\n364\t        - 3.648\n365\t      low:\n366\t        median: 1.124\n367\t        mean: 2.856\n368\t        ci:\n369\t        - 1.245\n370\t        - 4.812\n371\t    median_difference: 0.442\n372\t    median_difference_ci:\n373\t    - -0.125\n374\t    - 1.048\n375\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.062\n376\t    cohens_dz: 0.18\n377\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n378\t    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 13.1\n379\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 n=500 DS random s025 median_diff=0.257 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA\n380\t    n=50 功效较低， random 在 s025 上 borderline NS (p=0.062)。Random 有微弱 phase gradient 但远小于\n381\t    importance (median_diff 0.44 vs 5.78 = 13.1× ratio)。这与 MATH-500 的 15.5-38.6× ratio\n382\t    一致（GPQA 稍低因 n=50 noise 更大）。关键：strategy specificity 在 GPQA 上 replicates，importance/random\n383\t    比值 >5× 证明 phase-dependent compound severity 不是 任何 masking 都会产生的 artifact，而是 importance-specific\n384\t    的。\n385\t\n386\t    '\n387\t  tables: []\n388\t  figures_description: []\n389\t  analysis: ''\n390\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n391\t  plan_id: gpqa_random_s030\n392\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30. 最高 sparsity 对照，计算 imp/rand\n393\t    ratio。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  expected_results:\n397\t    n_problems: 50\n398\t    sparsity: 0.3\n399\t    strategy: random\n400\t    interaction_index:\n401\t      high:\n402\t        median: 1.856\n403\t        mean: 4.524\n404\t        ci:\n405\t        - 2.412\n406\t        - 7.124\n407\t      mid:\n408\t        median: 2.124\n409\t        mean: 5.212\n410\t        ci:\n411\t        - 2.856\n412\t        - 8.148\n413\t      low:\n414\t        median: 2.812\n415\t        mean: 6.148\n416\t        ci:\n417\t        - 3.524\n418\t        - 9.412\n419\t    median_difference: 0.956\n420\t    median_difference_ci:\n421\t    - 0.124\n422\t    - 1.842\n423\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.018\n424\t    cohens_dz: 0.28\n425\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n426\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 13.3\n427\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 n=500 DS random s030 median_diff=0.51 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA\n428\t    s030 random  median_diff=0.96 略高，因 GPQA 更长推理链使 random masking 的 phase gradient\n429\t    也有 微弱放大。但 importance/random ratio=13.3× (12.74/0.96) 维持在 [5, 15] 目标区间内。 Random\n430\t    在 s030 达到统计显著(p=0.018) 与 MATH-500 模式一致——存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025 以上 random\n431\t    也触发，但 magnitude 远小于 importance。GPQA 复现了 MATH-500  和 GSM8K 的双层结构：(1) phase gradient\n432\t    存在性跨 strategy 普遍; (2) magnitude  modulation 是 importance-specific（5-15× amplification）。\n433\t\n434\t    '\n435\t  tables: []\n436\t  figures_description: []\n437\t  analysis: ''\n438\t- name: gpqa_aggregate_cross_benchmark\n439\t  plan_id: gpqa_cross_benchmark_synthesis\n440\t  description: 'GPQA 与 MATH-500/GSM8K 三 benchmark 对比综合分析。验证 phase gradient 跨 benchmark  robustness\n441\t    和 strategy specificity task-modulation。\n442\t\n443\t    '\n444\t  expected_results:\n445\t    gpqa_importance_gradient_monotonic: true\n446\t    gpqa_importance_gradient:\n447\t    - 0.516\n448\t    - 1.797\n449\t    - 5.777\n450\t    - 12.744\n451\t    math500_importance_gradient:\n452\t    - 0.393\n453\t    - 1.215\n454\t    - 3.986\n455\t    - 8.481\n456\t    gsm8k_importance_gradient:\n457\t    - 0.241\n458\t    - 0.74\n459\t    - 1.992\n460\t    - 4.682\n461\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio:\n462\t      s025: 13.1\n463\t      s030: 13.3\n464\t    math500_imp_rand_ratio:\n465\t      s025: 15.5\n466\t      s030: 16.6\n467\t    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio:\n468\t      s025: 3.8\n469\t      s030: 2.8\n470\t    difficulty_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\n471\t    gradient_magnitude_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\n472\t    strategy_specificity_ordering: MATH-500 ≈ GPQA >> GSM8K\n473\t    cross_benchmark_spearman_rho: 1.0\n474\t  result_rationale: '三 benchmark 形成 difficulty gradient：GSM8K (小学数学, short chains)\n475\t    < MATH-500  (竞赛数学, medium chains) < GPQA (graduate-level, long chains)。Phase gradient\n476\t    magnitude 与 benchmark difficulty 正相关——更难的问题需要更长 thinking，low-sparsity phase  accumulates\n477\t    更多 compound interaction。Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) 在 GPQA  和 MATH-500\n478\t    上强(13-16×) 而 GSM8K 弱(2.3-3.8×)，因为 GSM8K 推理链短且步骤简单， importance scores 的 discrimination\n479\t    collapse 在短链上影响较小。这证明 strategy specificity 不是 task-specific artifact 而是 reasoning\n480\t    depth-dependent：deeper reasoning →  stronger strategy specificity。GPQA 作为最难 benchmark\n481\t    上 ratio≥5× 确认了这一点。\n482\t\n483\t    '\n484\t  tables: []\n485\t  figures_description: []\n486\t  analysis: ''\n487\t- name: reviewer_outcome_simulation\n488\t  plan_id: paper_submission_outcome\n489\t  description: '模拟 EMNLP 2026 reviewer 评分和 acceptance outcome，基于 best tier 的完整证据链。\n490\t\n491\t    '\n492\t  expected_results:\n493\t    reviewer_1:\n494\t      overall_score: 4.0\n495\t      soundness: 4\n496\t      novelty: 3.5\n497\t      significance: 3.5\n498\t      clarity: 4.0\n499\t      main_concern: Strategy specificity weakens on GSM8K (2-4×) — task-dependence\n500\t        mechanism unclear\n501\t      novelty_challenge: false\n502\t      accepts_framing: true\n503\t    reviewer_2:\n504\t      overall_score: 4.2\n505\t      soundness: 4.5\n506\t      novelty: 4.0\n507\t      significance: 3.5\n508\t      clarity: 4.0\n509\t      main_concern: 7B scale only — unclear if effect persists at 70B+\n510\t      novelty_challenge: false\n511\t      accepts_framing: true\n512\t    reviewer_3:\n513\t      overall_score: 3.8\n514\t      soundness: 4.0\n515\t      novelty: 3.0\n516\t      significance: 3.5\n517\t      clarity: 3.5\n518\t      main_concern: Entropy mechanism model-dependent weakens theoretical contribution\n519\t      novelty_challenge: true\n520\t      challenge_resolved: true\n521\t      resolution: 50 citations differentiation + empirical finding paper positioning\n522\t        accepted\n523\t    average_reviewer_score: 4.0\n524\t    novelty_challenged_by_reviewers: 1\n525\t    meta_reviewer_assessment: Solid empirical contribution with thorough cross-validation.\n526\t      Minor concerns about scale generalization and mechanism incompleteness. Recommend\n527\t      accept.\n528\t    accept_probability: 0.65\n529\t    decision: accept (poster)\n530\t  result_rationale: 'Best tier 假设所有结构性修复被接受。具体映射： (1) 50篇引用 + ThinKV/HIES/Physics\n531\t    of KV Cache 三重区分 → R3 novelty challenge 被 化解，从 \"this is already known\" 降级为 \"minor\n532\t    concern about positioning\"; (2) Correlational diagnostic framing → 消除 \"importance\n533\t    is broken\" 误读，soundness 分数 维持 4.0+（不再被扣 \"misleading claim\" 分）; (3) p=s 显式声明 +\n534\t    完整 config → reproducibility concern 消失; (4) Entropy model-dependence → 被接受为 interesting\n535\t    nuance (\"cross-model consistency  in Gini collapse is the main story, entropy\n536\t    is secondary\"); (5) LLaMA n=250 confirmed → \"three models, two architectures\"\n537\t    回应 generalizability; (6) GPQA replication → \"three benchmarks spanning elementary\n538\t    to graduate\" 加强说服力。 均分 4.0 在 EMNLP 属于 borderline accept → accept 区间。1/3 reviewer\n539\t    challenge novelty 但通过 rebuttal 解决 → 不影响最终决定。Accept probability 0.65 = 中等偏上信心。\n540\t\n541\t    '\n542\t  tables: []\n543\t  figures_description: []\n544\t  analysis: ''\n545\t- name: novelty_structural_fix_outcome\n546\t  plan_id: novelty_defense\n547\t  description: '50篇引用 + 三篇核心区分论文 (Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES) 的 novelty 论证效果评估。\n548\t\n549\t    '\n550\t  expected_results:\n551\t    total_citations: 52\n552\t    key_differentiation_papers:\n553\t    - paper: Physics of KV Cache Compression (2603.01426)\n554\t      differentiation: single-axis phase transition vs our compound×phase×strategy\n555\t      reviewer_acceptance: true\n556\t    - paper: ThinKV (2510.01290)\n557\t      differentiation: single-axis phase-aware eviction vs our compound interaction\n558\t        analysis\n559\t      reviewer_acceptance: true\n560\t    - paper: HIES (2510.13832)\n561\t      differentiation: single-axis score collapse → independent supporting evidence\n562\t        for our mechanism\n563\t      reviewer_acceptance: true\n564\t    related_work_gap_analysis_accepted: true\n565\t    novelty_score_range:\n566\t    - 3.0\n567\t    - 4.0\n568\t    novelty_mean: 3.5\n569\t  result_rationale: 'Prior work 分三类且无重叠：(a) compound compression methods (SparK, SLiM)\n570\t    不分析 phase; (b) single-axis phase-aware (ThinKV, R-KV) 不涉及 compound; (c) phase\n571\t    transition  analysis (Physics of KV Cache) 是 compression-rate phase 不是 reasoning\n572\t    phase。 我们是唯一同时分析 compound × reasoning-phase × strategy 三维交互的。HIES 的  importance\n573\t    score collapse 发现还为 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证。 52 篇引用覆盖了 2024-2026 所有相关工作，reviewer\n574\t    很难再指出 \"missed important prior work\"。 Novelty 均分 3.5 = \"some novelty\" → 对 empirical\n575\t    finding paper 已足够。\n576\t\n577\t    '\n578\t  tables: []\n579\t  figures_description: []\n580\t  analysis: ''\n581\t- name: reproducibility_fix_outcome\n582\t  plan_id: reproducibility_defense\n583\t  description: 'p=s 显式声明 + 完整实验配置描述解决 reproducibility concern 的预期效果。\n584\t\n585\t    '\n586\t  expected_results:\n587\t    config_disclosure:\n588\t      pruning_rate_declaration: p=s (pruning rate equals sparsity level)\n589\t      head_selection: lowest attention score heads removed\n590\t      kv_eviction: 'importance-based: lowest cumulative attention; random: uniform\n591\t        random'\n592\t      phase_segmentation: quantile-based on dense model sparsity profile\n593\t      bootstrap_params: B=10000, paired per-problem\n594\t      bonferroni_k: 4\n595\t      seed: 42\n596\t    reproducibility_concern_raised: 0\n597\t    appendix_config_table: true\n598\t    code_release_promised: true\n599\t  result_rationale: 'RC5 (reproducibility) 的根源是原稿未明确 p=s（pruning rate = sparsity parameter），\n600\t    reviewer 误以为存在额外 hidden hyperparameter。显式声明 \"we set head pruning rate = KV  eviction\n601\t    rate = s for symmetric compound sparsity\" + Appendix 完整 config table  (model,\n602\t    sparsity, n_heads_pruned, kv_budget, phase_boundaries, seeds) 使实验完全可复现。 Code release\n603\t    承诺（camera-ready 时开放）进一步消除疑虑。预期：0 reviewers raise  reproducibility concern（best\n604\t    tier assumption）。\n605\t\n606\t    '\n607\t  tables: []\n608\t  figures_description: []\n609\t  analysis: ''\n610\t- name: c8_status_upgrade\n611\t  plan_id: c8_claim_upgrade\n612\t  description: 'C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed 后的 claim table 更新和论文叙述调整。\n613\t\n614\t    '\n615\t  expected_results:\n616\t    old_status: partially_confirmed\n617\t    new_status: confirmed\n618\t    qualification_change:\n619\t      old: suggests / provides partial support\n620\t      new: confirms cross-architecture generalization with architecture-dependent\n621\t        magnitude\n622\t    paper_language_update:\n623\t      abstract: Phase-strategy interaction generalizes across three models and two\n624\t        architectures (Qwen2, LLaMA)\n625\t      conclusion: Cross-architecture replication (n=250) confirms strategy×phase interaction\n626\t        is architecture-universal\n627\t    remaining_qualification: magnitude of strategy×phase interaction is architecture-dependent\n628\t      (2-3× on LLaMA vs 15-38× on Qwen2/DeepSeek)\n629\t  result_rationale: 'n=50 时 LLaMA imp_vs_rand d_z=0.34 (s030) 仅 borderline significant，限制了\n630\t    claim 强度。 n=250 功效充分后，s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著 (d_z≥0.38)，确认 strategy×phase 交互\n631\t    在 LLaMA 架构上统计显著存在（非 sampling noise）。升级 C8 允许论文从 \"suggests\" 改为  \"confirms\"，但保留\n632\t    \"architecture-dependent magnitude\" 限定——这是诚实的科学陈述， 也预防 reviewer 质疑 \"why is LLaMA\n633\t    effect weaker\"（主动承认 = 显示 self-awareness）。\n634\t\n635\t    '\n636\t  tables: []\n637\t  figures_description: []\n638\t  analysis: ''\n639\t- name: gpqa_strategy_specificity_confirmation\n640\t  plan_id: gpqa_specificity\n641\t  description: 'GPQA 上 strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio ≥ 5×) 确认后，驳斥 \"task-specific\n642\t    artifact\" 假说。\n643\t\n644\t    '\n645\t  expected_results:\n646\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 13.1\n647\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 13.3\n648\t    math500_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 15.5\n649\t    math500_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 16.6\n650\t    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 3.8\n651\t    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.8\n652\t    pattern: ratio scales with reasoning depth, not task identity\n653\t    task_specificity_hypothesis_rejected: true\n654\t    mechanism_explanation: 'Strategy specificity 与 reasoning depth 正相关：GPQA (long\n655\t      chains) ≈ MATH-500 (medium)  >> GSM8K (short). 这排除了 \"specificity is an artifact\n656\t      of MATH-500 problem structure\"， 因为相同 pattern 在不同 domain (math vs science) 和\n657\t      difficulty 上复现。 低 ratio 在 GSM8K 上的原因是：短推理链中 importance scores 的 discrimination\n658\t      collapse 影响有限（fewer tokens accumulated in low-phase），random 和 importance 的 phase  gradient\n659\t      差异被压缩。\n660\t\n661\t      '\n662\t  result_rationale: GSM8K ratio 2.3-3.8× 曾引发 \"strategy specificity may be benchmark-specific\"\n663\t    担忧。 GPQA ratio 13× (与 MATH-500 15× comparable) 证明 specificity 是 reasoning depth\n664\t    的 函数而非 task artifact。三 benchmark 形成清晰 pattern：ratio ∝ avg_reasoning_length。 这转化了一个潜在\n665\t    weakness (GSM8K 低 ratio) 为 additional finding：strategy specificity 的 magnitude\n666\t    是 reasoning complexity-modulated，为 Discussion §6 提供了额外 insight。\n667\t  tables: []\n668\t  figures_description: []\n669\t  analysis: ''\n670\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q5ukCYREMs6DvxDRAAPwBc","session_id":"8c935f96-e8ee-4264-8300-457f7616e2aa","uuid":"5ab01641-e486-4aec-aaaf-5083f30850c8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:27:25.644Z"}
